  "$id": "https://tdn.local/contracts/analysis/insight-reader-input.schema.json",
  "title": "InsightReaderInput",
  "description": "Exact retained Insight reader build identity; frozen scope comes from authenticated start/scope. Method references bind owning-service-verified retained outputs, never injected summaries or copied private corpus. No calculation, model call, Metric profile or implicit approval.",
